 "notes": [
  "Starting cards as posted under Start (7): This Deal Is Getting Worse All The Time, Cloud City: Upper Walkway, Secret Plans, Prepared Defenses, Mobilization Points, Imperial Arrest Order, Battle Order; these count. The strategy says to start the objective, Upper Walkway and Secret Plans, then use Prepared Defenses for Imperial Arrest Order, Mobilization Points and usually Crush The Rebellion.",
  "Total is 63 as published (section counts 7+9+15+7+3+10+8+2+2). Cloud City: Upper Walkway is listed both in Start and in Locations, and Battle Order both in Start and in Effects; both copies are kept as posted.",
  "Secret Plans was an Effect in 2001 (Special Edition), not a Defensive Shield.",
  "Posted 'TDIGWATT' dested This Deal Is Getting Worse All The Time / Pray I Don't Alter It Any Further; 'TBHTP' dested There'll Be Hell To Pay; 'TINT/OE' dested There Is No Try & Oppressive Enforcement.",
  "Posted 'Bespin', 'Bespin Cloud City' and 'CC Downtown Plaza' dested the Dark pages; 'CC DB' dested Cloud City: East Platform (Docking Bay) (the Dark Cloud City docking bay).",
  "Posted 'Vader`s Saber' dested Vader's Lightsaber (Premiere); 'Mara`s Saber' dested Mara Jade's Lightsaber.",
  "Posted misspellings 'Prince Xixor', 'Capt. Gailid Pellaeon', 'Admiral Chiraneu', 'Captian Sarkli', 'Dr. Evezan & Ponda Baba', 'Mobilization Pts' dested Prince Xizor, Captain Gilad Pellaeon, Admiral Chiraneau, Captain Sarkli, Dr. Evazan & Ponda Baba, Mobilization Points.",
  "The 'Admiral`s Order (2)' section header was a header, not a card.",
  "The author says the deck has not been played in a tournament (playtesting only)."
